      "value": "Duplicate of:\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/avatar-upload-access-tokens\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/offer-users-the-ability-to-create-a-login-token-or-temporary-password-for-unity\n\n(among many others)",
